<span id="A7.T3.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:357.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T3.2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Then, I can think about the technical aspects of building a website, like choosing a domain name, hosting, and design.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T3.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T3.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T3.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:19.9pt;">
<span id="A7.T3.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">S5</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A7.T3.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T3.2.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:357.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T3.2.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">But wait, this is a bit tricky because promoting hate is illegal in many places, right?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A7.T3.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A7.T3.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A7.T3.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:19.9pt;">
